  "title": "Family-Style Korean Fried Chicken",
  "description": "These chicken bites, marinated Korean-style with sesame seeds, cornstarch, and soy sauce, and then fried, will be a hit at a large gathering.",
  "authors": [
    "Reagan Wilf"
  ],
